      ["Jedu do Prahy.","YEH-doo DOH prah-hih","I'm going to Prague.","jedu is by vehicle, now. Not jdu."],
      ["Pojedu do Brna.","POH-yeh-doo DOH brr-nah","I'll go to Brno.","do Brna is the chunk. Brno becomes Brna."],
      ["Jedu metrem.","YEH-doo MEH-trehm","I'm going by metro.","jet, not jít. metrem is the chunk for by metro."],
      ["Jedu autobusem.","YEH-doo OW-toh-boo-sehm","I'm going by bus.","The same verb as the metro."],
      ["na univerzitu","NAH oo-nih-vehr-zih-too","to the university","The chunk with na, not do. univerzita becomes univerzitu."],
      ["Půjdu na univerzitu.","POOHY-doo NAH oo-nih-vehr-zih-too","I'll walk to the university.","On foot, so jít."],
      ["Pojedu na univerzitu.","POH-yeh-doo NAH oo-nih-vehr-zih-too","I'll go to the university by vehicle.","A tram, a bus or a car, so jet."],
      ["doleva","DOH-leh-vah","to the left","When someone tells you the way."],
      ["doprava","DOH-prah-vah","to the right","When someone tells you the way."],
      ["rovně","ROHV-nyeh","straight ahead","v stays v before n."],
      ["Jděte rovně.","YDYEH-teh ROHV-nyeh","Go straight.","To a stranger. jděte is the vy-form of jít."],
      ["Pak doleva.","pahg DOH-leh-vah","Then to the left.","The next piece of a direction. The k in pak voices before d."],
      ["Budu studovat.","BOO-doo STOO-doh-vaht","I will study.","A plan. budu plus the base form."],
      ["Zítra pojedu do Ostravy.","ZEE-trah POH-yeh-doo DOH ohs-trah-vih","Tomorrow I'll go to Ostrava.","A vehicle, so jet. Ostrava becomes Ostravy after do."]
