      {"t":"fill","q":"Dám si __.","p":"I'll have a beer.","a":["pivo"],"o":["pivu","piva","pive"],"why":"pivo is neuter: no change."},
      {"t":"type","p":"I'll have soup.","a":["Dám si polévku.","Polévku si dám."],"hint":"dát si · polévka","x":["polévka"],"why":"polévka is feminine, and in the object slot the feminine form ends in -u."},
      {"t":"type","p":"Do you have a sister? (to a stranger)","a":["Máte sestru?","Vy máte sestru?"],"hint":"mít · sestra","x":["Máš"],"why":"Máte is the vy-form, and sestra becomes sestru."},
      {"t":"type","p":"I'm looking for Petr.","a":["Hledám Petra.","Petra hledám."],"hint":"hledat · Petr","x":["Petr"],"why":"Petr is a masculine person, so the masculine form for an object adds -a. hledám is the I-form."}
