      {"t":"fill","q":"Eva __ doma.","p":"Eva will be at home.","a":["bude"],"o":["budu","budete","je bude"],"why":"For she the form is bude."},
      {"t":"type","p":"I will study Czech.","a":["Budu studovat češtinu","Já budu studovat češtinu","Češtinu budu studovat"],"hint":"budu · studovat · čeština","x":["budete","studuju"],"why":"budu is the I-form, and studovat stays in its base form."},
      {"t":"type","p":"Will you be at home tomorrow? (to a stranger)","a":["Budete zítra doma","Budete doma zítra","Zítra budete doma"],"hint":"být · zítra · doma · the future starts with bud-","x":["budeš","budu"],"why":"budete is the vy-form of the future; budeš is the ty-form for a friend."},
      {"t":"type","p":"I'll take the metro.","a":["Pojedu metrem","Já pojedu metrem"],"hint":"jet · metrem · later: po-","x":["půjdu","budu"],"why":"A metro has wheels, so jet; the I-form for later is pojedu."}
